context:
DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/builds/tokens/{build_token_uuid}
Delete a stored build token owned by the current user.
Required: account_id (path); build_token_uuid (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/builds/workers/{script_name}/deploy_hooks/{deploy_hook_uuid}
Delete a deploy hook so its UUID can no longer start builds.
Required: account_id (path); script_name (path) — Human-readable name of the worker.; deploy_hook_uuid (path) — Deploy hook UUID

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/builds/triggers/{trigger_uuid}/environment_variables/{environment_variable_key}
Delete one build-time variable or secret by key.
Required: account_id (path); trigger_uuid (path); environment_variable_key (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/builds/repos/connections/{repo_connection_uuid}
Delete a saved repository connection.
Required: account_id (path); repo_connection_uuid (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/builds/triggers/{trigger_uuid}
Delete a trigger and cancel its unfinished builds.
Required: account_id (path); trigger_uuid (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/builds/workers/{script_tag}
Delete build settings and triggers for a Worker tag and cancel unfinished builds. The Worker is not deleted.
Required: account_id (path); script_tag (path) — The Worker script tag (external script ID)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/builds/builds/{build_uuid}
Retrieve status, outcome, timestamps, trigger settings, and source metadata for a build UUID.
Required: account_id (path); build_uuid (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/builds/workers/{script_name}/deploy_hooks/{deploy_hook_uuid}
Retrieve the name, branch, Worker identifier, and timestamps for a deploy hook.
Required: account_id (path); script_name (path) — Human-readable name of the worker.; deploy_hook_uuid (path) — Deploy hook UUID

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/builds/workers/{script_tag}
Retrieve the repository and production build settings associated with a Worker tag.
Required: account_id (path); script_tag (path) — The Worker script tag (external script ID)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/builds/workers/{script_name}/deploy_hooks/{deploy_hook_uuid}
Replace the name and target branch for a deploy hook.
Required: account_id (path); script_name (path) — Human-readable name of the worker.; deploy_hook_uuid (path) — Deploy hook UUID; body (body)

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/builds/triggers/{trigger_uuid}
Update commands, cache settings, or branch and path filters for a trigger.
Required: account_id (path); trigger_uuid (path); body (body)

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/builds/workers/{script_tag}
Update the repository branch or production build settings associated with a Worker tag.
Required: account_id (path); script_tag (path) — The Worker script tag (external script ID); body (body)
